; ============================================================================
; AD BYZANTINE HAWK-EYE INTELLIGENCE ENGINE — V4
; ============================================================================
; Owns threat truth. Consumes Promisory threat/scout signals, derives bounded
; beliefs, and exports strategic observation. It does NOT choose response mode,
; optionality, state, or attack commands.
; ============================================================================
